# Agit02DoomServantAgit (35632, level 68), every draw 0: a clan member (lidia_clan, range 1000) told
# of the hit on the servant wants to attack the character by the damage dealt. Its 3001 timer, first
# after 1 s, takes it back home (a DeleteObject for the character, who is 2000 away) when it stands
# out of its territory.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.WarriorBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.Warrior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorCastDDMagic.WarriorCastDDMagic
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorCastDDMagic.WarriorCastDDMagicAggressive
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorCastDDMagic.Agit02DoomServantAgit
npc servant 35632 Monster 300 0 0 level 68 skill DD_MAGIC 4034 6 clan lidia_clan 1000
npc mate 35632 Monster 400 0 0 level 68 skill DD_MAGIC 4034 6 clan lidia_clan 1000

tick x8
hit servant 10
  desires mate attack(player)=232.25454545454545
jump servant 2000 0 0
advance 2s
  S DeleteObject obj=servant
  at servant 300 0 0
